# Memory store — local state, never committed (FINDINGS.md D19).
# Memories live only in the local SQLite DB; the FTS5 and sqlite-vec indexes and the
# downloaded embedding model are all rebuildable, so none of it belongs in git.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.zikaron/
